{"ex-104-1":{"id":"ex-104-1","chapter":"104","number":1,"title":"水的加熱曲線","question":"<p>學生以恆定的功率把水加熱。下圖顯示水的温度隨時間的變化。</p><p>(a) 試簡單解釋為甚麼 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 段是一條橫線。</p><p>(b) 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 段，水有沒有吸收能量？</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的值是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/813e0aa66e89f15dc517dd23.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:351.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 段，水正在沸騰，所以温度保持不變。</p><p>(b) 有</p><p>(c) 100 °C</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>T 是水沸騰時的溫度。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":5,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,259.9469833984375,565.2833009033203,577.2189483642578],"text":"例 題 1 水的加熱曲線\r\n學生以恆定的功率把水加熱。下圖顯示水的温度隨時間的變化。\r\n0\r\n25\r\nT\r\nB\r\nA\r\nC\r\nD\r\n温度 / °C\r\n時間\r\n(a) 試簡單解釋為甚麼 BC 段是一條橫線。\r\n(b) 在 BC 段，水有沒有吸收能量？\r\n(c) T 的值是多少？\r\n"},{"page":5,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,577.2189483642578,565.2833009033203,681.7559833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 在 BC 段，水正在沸騰，所以温度保持不變。\r\n(b) 有\r\n(c) 100 °C\r\n"},{"page":5,"kind":"tips","box":[40,255.9469833984375,184.2833009033203,681.7559833984375],"text":"提提你\r\nT 是水沸騰時的温度。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-2":{"id":"ex-104-2","chapter":"104","number":2,"title":"熔冰所需的能量","question":"<p>求使 0.25 kg、溫度為 0 °C 的冰熔解所需的能量。已知冰的熔解比潛熱為 3.34 × 10<sup>5</sup> J kg<sup>−1</sup>。</p>","answer":"<p>所需的能量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ml_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.25 × (3.34 × 10<sup>5</sup>) = 8.35 × 10<sup>4</sup> J</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,146.15898339843739,565.2833009033203,241.47508239746094],"text":"例 題 2 熔冰所需的能量\r\n把 250 g 温度為 0 °C 的冰熔解變成水，所需的能量是多少？已知冰\r\n的熔解比潛熱是 3.34 × 105\r\n J kg–1。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,241.47508239746094,565.2833009033203,302.01198339843745],"text":"題 解\r\n所需的能量 = mlf = 0.25 × (3.34 × 105\r\n) = 8.35 × 104\r\n J\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-3":{"id":"ex-104-3","chapter":"104","number":3,"title":"水蒸氣和熱水","question":"<p>求以下情況釋放的能量：</p><p>(a) 質量為 15 g、溫度為 100 °C 的水冷卻至 50 °C；</p><p>(b) 質量為 15 g、溫度為 100 °C 的水蒸氣冷卻成 50 °C 的水。</p><p>已知水的比熱容量為 4200 J kg<sup>−1</sup> °C<sup>−1</sup>，水的汽化比潛熱為 2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup> J kg<sup>−1</sup>。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 釋放的能量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.015 × 4200 × (100 − 50) = 3150 J</p><p>(b) 釋放的能量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ml_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 0.015 × (2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup>) + 3150</p><p>= 37 050 J</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>簡圖：</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/d617234f56aeb2d57eb5d25b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:174.8px\"></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,464.26598339843747,565.2833009033203,625.5820617675781],"text":"例 題 3 水蒸氣和熱水\r\n求在下列情況釋放的能量：\r\n(a) 質量為 15 g 的水從 100 °C 冷卻至 50 °C。\r\n(b) 質量為 15 g 的 100 °C 水蒸氣冷卻為 50 °C 的水。\r\n已知水的比熱容量為 4200 J kg –1 ° C –1，水的汽化比潛熱為\r\n2.26 × 106\r\n J kg–1。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,625.5820617675781,565.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 釋放的能量 = mcΔT = 0.015 × 4200 × (100 − 50) = 3150 J\r\n(b) 釋放的能量 = mlv + mcΔT\r\n= 0.015 × (2.26 × 106\r\n) + 3150 \r\n= 37 050 J\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"tips","box":[40,460.26598339843747,184.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n簡圖：\r\nmc∆T\r\n水 (50 °C)\r\n水 (100 °C)\r\n提提你\r\n簡圖：\r\nmc∆T\r\nmlv\r\n水 (50 °C)\r\n水蒸氣 \r\n(100 °C)\r\n水\r\n(100 °C)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","question"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-4":{"id":"ex-104-4","chapter":"104","number":4,"title":"求冰的熔解比潛熱","question":"<p>蔚晴完成實驗 4c 後得出以下數據：</p><p>實驗燒杯中水的質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.050 kg 對照燒杯中水的質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.014 kg 電熱器提供的能量 = 14 200 J</p><p>(a) 寫出用來計算實驗中冰的熔解比潛熱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的方程。</p><p>(b) 利用以上數據，計算 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的標準值是 3.34 × 10<sup>5</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup>。求 (b) 所得結果的百分誤差。</p><p>(d) 指出可能引致誤差的一項因素。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(b) 經電熱器熔化的冰的質量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.050 − 0.014 = 0.036 kg</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>14200</mn><mn>0.036</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{14 200}{0.036}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 3.94 × 10<sup>5</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) 百分誤差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3.94</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3.34</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3.34</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3.94 \\times  10^{5} - 3.34 \\times  10^{5}}{3.34 \\times  10^{5}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100%</p><p>= 18.0%</p><p>(d) 冰並沒有吸收由電熱器提供的所有能量。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":12,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,304.4039833984375,560.2833009033203,537.7201385498047],"text":"例 題 4 求冰的熔解比潛熱\r\n蔚晴完成實驗 4c 後得出以下數據：\r\n實驗燒杯中水的質量 m1 = 0.050 kg\r\n對照燒杯中水的質量 m2 = 0.014 kg\r\n電熱器提供的能量 = 14 200 J\r\n(a) 寫出用來計算實驗中冰的熔解比潛熱 lf 的方程。\r\n(b) 利用以上數據，計算 lf。\r\n(c) lf 的標準值是 3.34 × 105\r\n J kg–1。求 (b) 所得結果的百分誤差。\r\n(d) 指出可能引致誤差的一項因素。\r\n"},{"page":12,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,537.7201385498047,560.2833009033203,747.7569833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) lf = Q\r\nm\r\n(b) 經電熱器熔化的冰的質量 = m1 − m2 = 0.050 − 0.014 = 0.036 kg\r\nlf = Q\r\nm = 14 200\r\n0.036\r\n = 3.94 × 105\r\n J kg–1\r\n(c) 百分誤差 = 3.94 × 105\r\n – 3.34 × 105\r\n3.34 × 105 × 100% \r\n = 18.0%\r\n(d) 冰並沒有吸收由電熱器提供的所有能量。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-5":{"id":"ex-104-5","chapter":"104","number":5,"title":"求水的汽化比潛熱","question":"<p>天朗用一個舊式的千瓦時計來做實驗 4d。根據這種千瓦時計上圓盤的轉動圈數，可計算出所提供的能量。</p><p>千瓦時計電熱器</p><p>圓盤燒杯</p><p>沸水電子秤</p><p>這種千瓦時計的標定是 600 轉∕kW h，即每轉提供的能量是 6000 J。</p><p>實驗得出以下數據：</p><p>水的初質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.82 kg 水的末質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.72 kg 圓盤轉動的圈數 = 41</p><p>(a) 寫出用來計算實驗中水的汽化比潛熱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的方程。</p><p>(b) 利用以上數據，計算 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 天朗建議在杯上加蓋以減低實驗誤差。試解釋為甚麼這並不是個好的建議。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(b) 汽化了的水的質量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> – <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.82 – 0.72 = 0.10 kg 用於汽化水的能量 = 6000 × 41 = 246 000 J</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>246000</mn><mn>0.10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{246 000}{0.10}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.46 × 10<sup>6</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) 水汽會在蓋的內表面凝結並流回杯中。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":14,"kind":"question","box":[183.4829864033203,342.06108629843754,560.4829864033203,749.2040862984375],"text":"例 題 5 求水的汽化比潛熱\r\n天朗用一個舊式的千瓦時計來做實驗 4d。根據這種千瓦時計上圓盤的\r\n轉動圈數，可計算出所提供的能量。\r\n電熱器\r\n燒杯\r\n千瓦時計\r\n圓盤\r\n沸水 電子秤\r\n這種千瓦時計的標定是600轉／kW h，即每轉提供的能量是6000 J。\r\n實驗得出以下數據：\r\n水的初質量 m1 = 0.82 kg\r\n水的末質量 m2 = 0.72 kg\r\n圓盤轉動的圈數 = 41\r\n(a) 寫出用來計算實驗中水的汽化比潛熱 lv 的方程。\r\n(b) 利用以上數據，計算 lv。\r\n(c) 天朗建議在杯上加蓋以減低實驗誤差。試解釋為甚麼這並不是個\r\n好的建議。\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[188.49090580332032,58.91007995605469,565.4909058033203,226.44710639843743],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) lv = Q\r\nm\r\n(b) 汽化了的水的質量 = m1 – m2 = 0.82 – 0.72 = 0.10 kg\r\n用於汽化水的能量 = 6000 × 41 = 246 000 J\r\nlv = Q\r\nm = 246 000\r\n0.10\r\n = 2.46 × 106\r\n J kg–1\r\n(c) 水汽會在蓋的內表面凝結並流回杯中。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-6":{"id":"ex-104-6","chapter":"104","number":6,"title":"把湯翻熱","question":"<p>美儀利用蒸鍋，把 250 g 蕃茄湯從 4 °C 開始翻熱。過程中，有 20 g 温度為 100 °C 的水蒸氣在湯面凝結。已知蕃茄湯和水的比熱容量分別為 3700 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup> 和 4200 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup>，取水的汽化比潛熱為2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求蕃茄湯的末温度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>。假設沒有能量散失到周圍環境。</p><p>(b) 假設散失到周圍環境的能量不可忽略。試比較蕃茄湯的實際末温度和 (a) 所求得的答案。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/78d73f72b2a72e51e9b97d9b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:228.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 水蒸氣失去的能量 = 湯獲得的能量</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>0.02 × (2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup>) + 0.02 × 4200 × (100 − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>) = 0.25 × 3700 × (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> − 4)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 56.8 °C</p><p>(b) 由於有部分能量散失到周圍環境，蕃茄湯實際上只能吸收到較少的能量，因此末温度會較低。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,53.84898339843744,565.2833009033203,326.8435516357422],"text":"例 題 6 把湯翻熱\r\n美儀利用蒸鍋，把 250 g 蕃茄湯從 4 °C 開始翻熱。過程中，有 20 g\r\n温度為 100 °C 的水蒸氣在湯面凝結。已知蕃茄湯和水的比熱容量\r\n分別為 3700 J kg–1 °C–1 和 4200 J kg–1 °C–1，取水的汽化比潛熱為\r\n2.26 × 106\r\n J kg–1。\r\n(a) 求蕃茄湯的末温度 T。假設沒有能量散失到周圍環境。\r\n(b) 假設散失到周圍環境的能量不可忽略。試比較蕃茄湯的實際末温\r\n度和 (a) 所求得的答案。\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,326.8435516357422,565.2833009033203,485.3809833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 水蒸氣失去的能量 = 湯獲得的能量\r\nmslv + mwcwΔTw = mtctΔTt\r\n 0.02 × (2.26 × 106\r\n) + 0.02 × 4200 × (100 − T) = 0.25 × 3700 × (T − 4)\r\nT = 56.8 °C\r\n(b) 由於有部分能量散失到周圍環境，蕃茄湯實際上只能吸收到較少\r\n的能量，因此末温度會較低。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-7":{"id":"ex-104-7","chapter":"104","number":7,"title":"翻熱蔬菜","question":"<p>嘉儀用蒸鍋翻熱 800 g 温度為 25 °C 的蔬菜。</p><p>已知：</p><p>水的汽化比潛熱 = 2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup> 水的比熱容量 = 4200 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup> 蔬菜的比熱容量 = 3000 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup></p><p>水沸騰後，嘉儀把蔬菜放進蒸鍋內加熱 10 分鐘。假設有一半水蒸氣都在蔬菜上凝結，而供應能量給水的功率是 500 W。</p><p>(a) 在蔬菜上凝結的水蒸氣，總質量是多少？</p><p>(b) 估算蔬菜的末温度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/6572fcc6d5841c4cd0e3ff07.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:346.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 蒸鍋提供的能量 = 100 °C 水獲得的能量</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ml_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>500 × (10 × 60) = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> × (2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup>)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.1062 kg</p><p>凝結在蔬菜上的水蒸氣總質量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 0.1062</p><p>= 0.0531 kg</p><p>(b) 水蒸氣失去的能量 = 蔬菜獲得的能量</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>0.0531 × (2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup>) + 0.0531 × 4200 × (100 − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>) = 0.8 × 3000 × (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> − 25)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 77.1 °C</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>質量為 m、溫度為 100 °C 的水，在 10 分鐘內變成 100 °C 的水蒸氣。</p><p>編輯核對</p><p>編輯核對：上方保留原印刷版解答。按題目所述的 500 W 功率，產生的水蒸氣質量為 0.1327 kg，其中 0.0664 kg 凝結。代入能量平衡式，得到最終溫度 88.8 °C。原印刷版的 0.1062 kg 和 77.1 °C 與題目所述功率不一致。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":20,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,86.06398339843747,560.4833009033202,481.62156677246094],"text":"例 題 7 翻熱蔬菜\r\n嘉儀用蒸鍋翻熱 800 g 温度為 25 °C 的蔬菜。\r\n已知：\r\n水的汽化比潛熱 = 2.26 × 106\r\n J kg–1\r\n水的比熱容量 = 4200 J kg–1 °C–1\r\n蔬菜的比熱容量 = 3000 J kg–1 °C–1\r\n水沸騰後，嘉儀把蔬菜放進蒸鍋內加熱 10 分鐘。假設有一半水蒸氣都\r\n在蔬菜上凝結，而供應能量給水的功率是 500 W。\r\n(a) 在蔬菜上凝結的水蒸氣，總質量是多少？\r\n(b) 估算蔬菜的末温度 T。\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,481.62156677246094,560.4833009033202,746.2039833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 蒸鍋提供的能量 = 100 °C 水獲得的能量\r\nPt = mlv\r\n 500 × (10 × 60) = m × (2.26 × 106\r\n)\r\nm = 0.1062 kg\r\n凝結在蔬菜上的水蒸氣總質量 = 1\r\n2\r\n× 0.1062\r\n= 0.0531 kg\r\n(b) 水蒸氣失去的能量 = 蔬菜獲得的能量\r\n mslv + mwcwΔTw = mvcvΔTv\r\n 0.0531×(2.26×106\r\n)+0.0531×4200×(100−T) = 0.8×3000×(T−25)\r\n T = 77.1 °C\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"tips","box":[40,82.06398339843747,179.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n質量為 m、温 度 為100 °C\r\n的水在 10 分鐘內變成\r\n100 °C 的水蒸氣。\r\nmlv\r\n水蒸氣 \r\n(100 °C)\r\n水 \r\n(100 °C)\r\nmwcw∆Tw\r\nmvcv∆Tv\r\nmslv\r\n蔬菜 (T) 水 (T)\r\n蔬菜 (25 °C)\r\n水蒸氣\r\n(100 °C)\r\n水\r\n(100 °C)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-8":{"id":"ex-104-8","chapter":"104","number":8,"title":"把水加熱","question":"<p>以恆定功率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 加熱 500 g 水，得出以下加熱曲線（橙線）。</p><p>取水的比熱容量為 4200 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 據此，估算水的汽化比潛熱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 以相同功率加熱 500 g 的另一液體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>，其加熱曲線（綠線）也在圖中顯示。比較液體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和水的下列物理量，並簡單解釋。</p><p>(i) 沸點</p><p>(ii) 比熱容量</p><p>(iii) 汽化比潛熱</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/d82ffd137af37c2b0f8fdb78.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:309.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 加熱提供的能量 = 水獲得的能量</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> × (2 × 60) = 0.5 × 4200 × (100 − 20)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1400 W</p><p>(b) 電熱器提供的能量 = 水獲得的能量</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>1400 × (15 × 60) = 0.5<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.52 × 10<sup>6</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在較低温度沸騰，因此沸點較低。</p><p>(ii) 相同質量的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和水以相同功率加熱時，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的温度上升得較慢，因此它的比熱容量較高。</p><p>(iii) 相同質量的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和水以相同功率加熱時，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 完全汽化所需的時間較短，因此它的汽化比潛熱較低。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>在 0−2 min 期間，水溫由 20 °C 上升至 100 °C。</p><p>提示</p><p>在 2−17 min 期間，所有水均變成水蒸氣。</p><p>提示</p><p>比熱容量越高，使溫度上升以下幅度所需的能量便越多：</p><p>1 °C.</p><p>提示</p><p>比潛熱越高，使 1 kg 物質由一種狀態變成另一種狀態所需的能量便越多。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,565.2833009033203,426.4512481689453],"text":"例 題 8 把水加熱\r\n以恆定功率 P 加熱 500 g 水，得出以下加熱曲線（橙線）。\r\n0 2\r\n20\r\n17 時間 / 分鐘\r\n温度 / °C\r\n水\r\n液體 X\r\n取水的比熱容量為 4200 J kg–1 °C–1。\r\n(a) 求 P。\r\n(b) 據此，估算水的汽化比潛熱 lv。\r\n(c) 以相同功率加熱 500 g 的另一液體 X，其加熱曲線（綠線）也在圖\r\n中顯示。比較液體 X 和水的下列物理量，並簡單解釋。\r\n (i) 沸點\r\n (ii) 比熱容量\r\n (iii) 汽化比潛熱\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,426.4512481689453,565.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 加熱提供的能量 = 水獲得的能量\r\nPt = mcΔT\r\nP × (2 × 60) = 0.5 × 4200 × (100 − 20)\r\nP = 1400 W\r\n(b) 電熱器提供的能量 = 水獲得的能量\r\nPt = mslv\r\n 1400 × (15 × 60) = 0.5lv\r\nlv = 2.52 × 106\r\n J kg–1\r\n(c) (i) X 在較低温度沸騰，因此沸點較低。\r\n(ii) 相同質量的 X 和水以相同功率加熱時，X 的温度上升得較\r\n慢，因此它的比熱容量較高。\r\n(iii) 相同質量的 X 和水以相同功率加熱時，X 完全汽化所需的時\r\n間較短，因此它的汽化比潛熱較低。\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,184.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n在0至2分鐘期間，水温從\r\n20 °C 上升至100 °C。\r\n提提你\r\n在2至17分 鐘 期 間，所 有\r\n水變成水蒸氣。\r\n提提你\r\n比熱容量較高，表示把温度\r\n升高1 °C 所需的能量較多。\r\n提提你\r\n比 潛 熱 較 高，表 示 把1 kg\r\n物質由一物態轉換至另一物\r\n態所需的能量較多。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-104-9":{"id":"ex-104-9","chapter":"104","number":9,"title":"流汗的冷卻作用","question":"<p>依晴的質量是 50 kg。她正在做運動，身上滿是汗水。</p><p>(a) 當 650 g 的汗水蒸發，所帶走的能量是多少？假設汗水的汽化比潛熱是 2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup> J kg<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(b) 如果上述的能量無法釋放，依晴的體温會增加多少？取人體的平均比熱容量為 3500 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(c) 以分子運動來解釋蒸發為甚麼會發生。</p><p>(d) 如果人體的體温過高，就會導致中暑。試解釋為甚麼在濕度較高的日子，中暑的風險較大。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 帶走的能量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ml_{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 0.65 × (2.26 × 10<sup>6</sup>)</p><p>= 1.469 × 10<sup>6</sup> ≈ 1.47 × 10<sup>6</sup> J</p><p>(b) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p>1.469 × 10<sup>6</sup> = 50 × 3500 × Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 8.39 °C 依晴的體温會增加 8.39 °C。</p><p>(c) 液體表面的部分分子獲得足夠的動能，便會逃離液體進入液體上方空間，成為蒸氣分子。</p><p>(d) 在潮濕的日子，汗水蒸發得較慢，人體無法有效地經汗水蒸發來散熱，因此中暑的風險較大。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_104_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9a18f111b8517bbd72e622a4cfaec8629757bceb9ce2a10d886efdddffadc17f","segments":[{"page":31,"kind":"question","box":[188.28297420332035,516.3316848984375,565.2829742033204,736.0316848984376],"text":"例 題 9 流汗的冷卻作用\r\n依晴的質量是 50 kg。她正在做運動，身上滿是汗水。\r\n(a) 當 650 g 的汗水蒸發，所帶走的能量是多少？假設汗水的汽化比\r\n潛熱是 2.26 × 106\r\n J kg–1。\r\n(b) 如果上述的能量無法釋放，依晴的體温會增加多少？取人體的平\r\n均比熱容量為 3500 J kg–1 °C–1。\r\n(c) 以分子運動來解釋蒸發為甚麼會發生。\r\n(d) 如果人體的體温過高，就會導致中暑。試解釋為甚麼在濕度較高\r\n的日子，中暑的風險較大。\r\n"},{"page":32,"kind":"answer","box":[183.28300480332032,64.91007995605469,560.2830048033203,330.4471063984374],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 帶走的能量 = mlv\r\n= 0.65 × (2.26 × 106\r\n) \r\n= 1.469 × 106 ≈ 1.47 × 106\r\n J\r\n(b) 根據 Q = mcΔT，\r\n 1.469 × 106\r\n = 50 × 3500 × ΔT\r\nΔT = 8.39 °C\r\n依晴的體温會增加 8.39 °C。\r\n(c) 液體表面的部分分子獲得足夠的動能，便會逃離液體進入液體上\r\n方空間，成為蒸氣分子。\r\n(d) 在潮濕的日子，汗水蒸發得較慢，人體無法有效地經汗水蒸發來\r\n散熱，因此中暑的風險較大。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}